R+ images will be hidden from the gallery. LoRA model trained with Krea 2 (Z Image Turbo and Flux 2).
Putting a Like to the V67 models is worth more than giving me Buzz (yellow/green).This LoRA component was created to showcase images generated using the new features of Promptyx (https://perchance.org/promptyx). The components being added are: Lighting; Camera & Lens;
